    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ほら、飲み物、好きなの取ってくれ\r\nトレーナーさんもよかったらどうぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "え、私もいいんですか？\r\nじゃあ、遠慮なくいただいちゃおうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今、トレーナーさんと『恋ませ』の話してたんだよ～\r\n見てくれたんだって～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、そうなんですか？\r\nありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうでした？\r\nお陰様で、結構話題になってるみたいなんですけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "もう、続きが気になっちゃって……！\r\n雛菜ちゃんに聞いても教えてくれないんですよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "トレーナーさんでも、それはダメですよ\r\n続きを楽しみにしててください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ほら～、だめだって\r\n雛菜も言ったのに～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "あはは、ごめんって！\r\nでも、トール君？　健気で好きになっちゃったな～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "もちろん、雛菜ちゃんは\r\nいつもの雛菜ちゃんが出ててよかったけどね！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ね、あの人すごかった～\r\n普通に台本あるのに、なんともない顔で嘘つくんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、びっくりしちゃったよ～\r\n実際放送されたのでも、すっごい自然だったよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "え……！\r\nそ、そうなの……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……すみません\r\nこれ、オフレコで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "そ、それはもちろん！\r\nでも、え～…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、すごいよね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜も『恋ませ』も『G.R.A.D.』も頑張ってるし、\r\nみんなに見てもらわないとな～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "見てね～って、\r\n今日もツイスタ更新しなきゃ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それなら今\r\n写真でも撮ろうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……うん！\r\nね、トレーナーさんも写真、一緒に写ってください～！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300302/1023003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "え……、私も！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003020180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そう～！\r\nほら、プロデューサー撮って～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
